  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Living in Harmony with Nature: promote ecologically sustainable approach to urban design and planning</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to promote the inclusive and ecologically sustainable approach to urbanization, in order to better protect green coverage, biodiversity and sustainable lifestyle in Vietnam.

This project aims to improve the knowledge and awareness of local people and authorities about the importance of inclusive and ecological approach to urbanization and development. In particular, it will (i) set up demonstration on the ground to not only improve the living conditions of the most marginalized communities in Hanoi but also provide inputs for policy advocacy and public education purposes; (ii) increase the awareness of local people on the important role of nature and biodiversity for sustainable development through various educational activities; (iii) mobilize support from local people and policy makers for inclusive and ecologically sustainable urban planning and development.</narrative>
  </description>
